   "type": "text",
   "html": "<p>Course: SCI-6478 Informal Robotic<br>Instructor: Chuck Hoberman<br>Project Duration: 6 Weeks</p>\n<p>Team members: Kai Zhang, Claire Dorsett, Oskar Nilsson</p>",
   "kind": "credits",
   "layout": "credits"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "html": "<p>My Contributions:<br>[1] Collaborated with Professor Hoberman, together we adapted the new fabrication method (3D-printed panels + Mylar) into final production.<br>[2] Used grasshopper to procedurally generate whole robot and simulate its movement.<br>[3] Defined the final aesthetic and overall details, and prepared production files.</p>",
   "kind": "text"
